{"id":"en_heir-s-wrath","title":"Heir’s Wrath","titleEn":"Heir’s Wrath","description":"After serving ten years behind bars for a crime his father committed, Desmond Kensington finally returns home. His purpose is simple: to rescue his mother from the hardship she has endured. Yet the homecoming brings no relief. Instead of peace, he finds himself subjected to unrelenting torment that threatens everything he hoped to rebuild. The series follows his struggle against those who continue to make his life unbearable, even after he has already paid a decade-long price for someone else's actions. Dramzio lets viewers follow this story of family sacrifice and the cruelty that greets a man seeking only to protect the person he loves.","poster":"https://pub-fd04cb02d0724cbe8719ff59aba68757.r2.dev/series/nt_heir-s-wrath/cover.jpg","backdrop":"https://pub-fd04cb02d0724cbe8719ff59aba68757.r2.dev/series/nt_heir-s-wrath/cover.jpg","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Identitas Rahasia","دراما قصيرة","الحضر","من الصفر إلى بطل","الانتقام","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnw9g/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_heir-s-wrath_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnw9g/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_heir-s-wrath_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnw9g/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_heir-s-wrath_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnw9g/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_heir-s-wrath_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD